    "title": "GATEWAY-apiwizdoc-Create Telecom Sim Replacement-v1-spec",
    "description": "The Telecom SIM Replacement API enables service providers to facilitate the efficient replacement of telecom SIM cards for their customers. This endpoint allows for the initiation of a SIM card replacement process, ensuring continuity of service and minimizing disruption for users. Common consumers of this API include telecom operators and customer service teams who need to manage SIM replacements in response to customer requests. This API streamlines the workflow involved in replacing SIM cards, enhancing customer satisfaction and service reliability.",
